    "title": "SI Tickets",
    "description": "SI Tickets is a fan-first ticketing company offering millions of sports, concerts and theater tickets. \r\n\r\nAt SI Tickets, fans have the trust of one of the worlds most iconic brands, We have a best in class fan guarantee providing a 100% refund if an event is canceled for any reason. \r\n\r\nSI Tickets' exclusive postseason marketplace empowers fans to buy and sell postseason ticket reservations to see their team in the biggest games. We offer reservations in the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, College Football and College Basketball. Choose the team, seating zone, and the number of tickets. Pay a reservation fee and lock in a ticket cost. Then when your team makes the game, you don't have to worry about securing your seats to the biggest game of the year.",
